WEBVTT

00:00:28.858 --> 00:00:31.402
And I still love that feeling,

00:00:31.402 --> 00:00:34.113
which to me is just thrilling.

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:35.656
I did it recently.

00:00:35.656 --> 00:00:37.533
My laptop was overheating,

00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:39.118
I thought it might be the fan,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.328
I ordered a fan,

00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:42.914
I put the fan in, I turned it on,

00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:44.415
and the fan went "whir"

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:46.834
like, “Yes! That really worked.”

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.128
It was a great feeling.

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:53.966
Now I know this kind of repair
probably sounds very old-fashioned,

00:00:54.008 --> 00:00:56.010
and I probably look
a little old-fashioned,

00:00:56.052 --> 00:00:59.555
but it's much more than saving money.

00:00:59.597 --> 00:01:02.433
It's how we keep the things
that we like in use.